{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# APIs & Keys Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Store API keys safely"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Never put API keys in code. Use environment variables."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=\"sk-ant-...\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "export OPENAI_API_KEY=\"sk-...\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Or use a `.env` file (add it to `.gitignore`):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: First API call (Python)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import anthropic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "client = anthropic.Anthropic()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "response = client.messages.create("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    model=\"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    max_tokens=256,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is a neural network in one sentence?\"}]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(response.content[0].text)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: First API call (TypeScript)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import Anthropic from \"@anthropic-ai/sdk\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "const client = new Anthropic();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "const response = await client.messages.create({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  model: \"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  max_tokens: 256,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"What is a neural network in one sentence?\" }],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "});"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "console.log(response.content[0].text);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Raw HTTP (no SDK)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import os"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import urllib.request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "url = \"https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "headers = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"x-api-key\": os.environ[\"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\"],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"anthropic-version\": \"2023-06-01\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "body = json.dumps({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"max_tokens\": 256,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is a neural network in one sentence?\"}],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}).encode()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "req = urllib.request.Request(url, data=body, headers=headers, method=\"POST\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "with urllib.request.urlopen(req) as resp:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    result = json.loads(resp.read())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(result[\"content\"][0][\"text\"])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This is what the SDKs do under the hood. Understanding the raw HTTP call helps when debugging."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Get an Anthropic API key and make your first API call\n2. Try the raw HTTP version and compare the response format to the SDK version\n3. Intentionally use a wrong API key and read the error message"
      ]
    }
